Package: rbr.binary.fs
Title: Feature Selection in Binary Classification Problems Using Relative
    Belief Ratio
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ayman", "Alzaatreh", role = "aut"),
    person("Maher", "Emarly", email = "maheremarly1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Rohan", "Mitra", role = "aut"),
    person("Luai", "Al-Labadi", role = "aut"))
Description: Code for the paper of the same name (Physica Scripta 100(8),
    086010, 2025). Scores each continuous feature by the relative belief ratio
    evidence against equality of its class-conditional means, ranks the features
    by the resulting strength, and evaluates the ranking against information
    gain and symmetric uncertainty with four classifiers under cross-validation.
    This is a research project, not an installable package: the modules in R/
    are sourced by the entry points in scripts/.
